{"speciesId":273,"names":{"fr":"Grainipiot","es":"Seedot","en":"Seedot","ja":"タネボー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SEEDOT attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. It sucks moisture from the tree while hanging off the branch. The more water it drinks, the glossier this POKéMON’s body becomes."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SEEDOT looks exactly like an acorn when it is dangling from a tree branch. It startles other POKéMON by suddenly moving. This POKéMON polishes its body once a day using leaves."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It hangs off branches and absorbs nutrients. When it finishes eating, its body becomes so heavy that it drops to the ground with a thump."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"If it remains still, it becomes impossible to distinguish from real nuts. It delights in surprising foraging PIDGEY."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"If it remains still, it becomes impossible to distinguish from real nuts. It delights in surprising foraging PIDGEY."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ressemble à un gland pendu à une branche. Il adore effrayer les autres Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il ressemble à un gland pendu à une branche. Il adore effrayer les autres Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se suspend aux branches par l’extrémité de sa tête. Il arrive qu’il tombe s’il est pris de panique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se cuelga de las ramas con el extremo de su cabeza. A veces se cae cuando soplan vientos fuertes."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"頭の 先を 枝に くっつけて ぶら下がる。強風に あおられ 落ちてしまう ことも あるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il ressemble à un gland pendu à une branche. Il adore effrayer les autres Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando cuelga de las ramas, parece una bellota. Le encanta asustar a otros Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"枝に ぶらさがっていると 木の実に そっくり。ついばもうとした ポケモンを 驚かせて 喜ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Grainipiot s’accroche par la tête aux branches d’arbre. Il en profite alors pour absorber l’humidité de l’arbre. Plus ce Pokémon boit d’eau, plus son corps devient brillant."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Seedot se queda enganchado a las ramas de los árboles por el extremo que tiene en la cabeza. Mientras está ahí colgado, aprovecha para tomar la humedad del árbol. Cuanta más agua bebe, más lustroso se le ve."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Seedot attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. It sucks moisture from the tree while hanging off the branch. The more water it drinks, the glossier this Pokémon’s body becomes."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頭の てっぺんを 木の 枝に くっつけて ぶら下がり ながら 水分を 吸い取っている。 水を 飲むほど 体が ツヤツヤ 光る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Grainipiot ressemble à s’y méprendre à un gland quand il s’accroche à une branche. Il effraie les autres Pokémon quand il se met à bouger. Ce Pokémon se lustre le corps une fois par jour avec des feuilles."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Seedot es igualito a una bellota colgada de la rama de un árbol. A veces asusta a más de un Pokémon con movimientos repentinos. Seedot suele acicalarse con hojas una vez al día."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Seedot looks exactly like an acorn when it is dangling from a tree branch. It startles other Pokémon by suddenly moving. This Pokémon polishes its body once a day using leaves."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"枝に ぶら下がる 姿は きのみ そっくり。 いきなり 動いて ポケモンを ビックリさせる。 １日 １回 葉っぱで 体を 磨くよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"S’il reste immobile, il a l’air d’une Baie. Il adore surprendre les Pokémon qui tentent de le picorer."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando se queda inmóvil, parece una bellota de verdad. Le encanta sorprender a los Pokémon que se acercan a picotearlo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If it remains still, it looks just like a real nut. It delights in surprising foraging Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"じっと 動かずに いると 木の実と そっくり。 ついばみに やって来た ポケモンを 驚かせて 遊ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se suspend aux branches par l’extrémité de sa tête. Il arrive qu’une bo